=head2 Service Client: Google::Container::V1::ClusterService::ClusterManagerClient

Client stub representing the remote C<ClusterManager> gRPC service. Delegates call dispatching to L<Google::gRPC::Client>.

=head3 target

The endpoint target address. Defaults to C<container.googleapis.com:443>.

=head3 credentials

The authentication credentials provider. Defaults to application default credentials via L<Google::Auth>.

=cut

use Moo;
