=item * C<< $msg->fleet() >> / C<< $msg->fleet($value) >>

Type: C<Message> (L<Google::Container::V1::ClusterService::Fleet>)

Fleet information for the cluster.

=item * C<< $msg->security_posture_config() >> / C<< $msg->security_posture_config($value) >>

Type: C<Message> (L<Google::Container::V1::ClusterService::SecurityPostureConfig>)

Optional. Enable/Disable Security Posture API features for the cluster.

=item * C<< $msg->control_plane_endpoints_config() >> / C<< $msg->control_plane_endpoints_config($value) >>

Type: C<Message> (L<Google::Container::V1::ClusterService::ControlPlaneEndpointsConfig>)

Configuration for all cluster's control plane endpoints.

=item * C<< $msg->enable_k8s_beta_apis() >> / C<< $msg->enable_k8s_beta_apis($value) >>

Type: C<Message> (L<Google::Container::V1::ClusterService::K8sBetaAPIConfig>)

Beta APIs Config

=item * C<< $msg->enterprise_config() >> / C<< $msg->enterprise_config($value) >>

Type: C<Message> (L<Google::Container::V1::ClusterService::EnterpriseConfig>)

GKE Enterprise Configuration.

