=item * C<< $msg->secret_manager_config() >> / C<< $msg->secret_manager_config($value) >>

Type: C<Message> (L<Google::Container::V1::ClusterService::SecretManagerConfig>)

Secret CSI driver configuration.

=item * C<< $msg->compliance_posture_config() >> / C<< $msg->compliance_posture_config($value) >>

Type: C<Message> (L<Google::Container::V1::ClusterService::CompliancePostureConfig>)

Optional. Deprecated: Compliance Posture is no longer supported.
For more details, see
https://cloud.google.com/kubernetes-engine/docs/deprecations/posture-management-deprecation.

Enable/Disable Compliance Posture features for the cluster.

=item * C<< $msg->satisfies_pzs() >> / C<< $msg->satisfies_pzs($value) >>

Type: C<Bool>

Output only. Reserved for future use.

=item * C<< $msg->satisfies_pzi() >> / C<< $msg->satisfies_pzi($value) >>

Type: C<Bool>

Output only. Reserved for future use.

=item * C<< $msg->user_managed_keys_config() >> / C<< $msg->user_managed_keys_config($value) >>

Type: C<Message> (L<Google::Container::V1::ClusterService::UserManagedKeysConfig>)

