Deprecated: Use
desired_control_plane_endpoints_config.ip_endpoints_config.global_access
instead.

=item * C<< $msg->desired_intra_node_visibility_config() >> / C<< $msg->desired_intra_node_visibility_config($value) >>

Type: C<Message> (L<Google::Container::V1::ClusterService::IntraNodeVisibilityConfig>)

The desired config of Intra-node visibility.

=item * C<< $msg->desired_default_snat_status() >> / C<< $msg->desired_default_snat_status($value) >>

Type: C<Message> (L<Google::Container::V1::ClusterService::DefaultSnatStatus>)

The desired status of whether to disable default sNAT for this cluster.

=item * C<< $msg->desired_release_channel() >> / C<< $msg->desired_release_channel($value) >>

Type: C<Message> (L<Google::Container::V1::ClusterService::ReleaseChannel>)

