=item * C<< $msg->desired_l4ilb_subsetting_config() >> / C<< $msg->desired_l4ilb_subsetting_config($value) >>

Type: C<Message> (L<Google::Container::V1::ClusterService::ILBSubsettingConfig>)

The desired L4 Internal Load Balancer Subsetting configuration.

=item * C<< $msg->desired_datapath_provider() >> / C<< $msg->desired_datapath_provider($value) >>

Type: C<Enum> (L<Google::Container::V1::DatapathProvider>)

The desired datapath provider for the cluster.

=item * C<< $msg->desired_private_ipv6_google_access() >> / C<< $msg->desired_private_ipv6_google_access($value) >>

Type: C<Enum> (L<Google::Container::V1::PrivateIPv6GoogleAccess>)

