If this field is not present, the taints will not be changed. Otherwise,
the existing node taints will be *replaced* with the provided taints.

=item * C<< $msg->labels() >> / C<< $msg->labels($value) >>

Type: C<Message> (L<Google::Container::V1::ClusterService::NodeLabels>)

The desired node labels to be applied to all nodes in the node pool.
If this field is not present, the labels will not be changed. Otherwise,
the existing node labels will be *replaced* with the provided labels.

=item * C<< $msg->linux_node_config() >> / C<< $msg->linux_node_config($value) >>

Type: C<Message> (L<Google::Container::V1::ClusterService::LinuxNodeConfig>)

Parameters that can be configured on Linux nodes.

=item * C<< $msg->kubelet_config() >> / C<< $msg->kubelet_config($value) >>

Type: C<Message> (L<Google::Container::V1::ClusterService::NodeKubeletConfig>)

