=head2 Google::Container::V1::ClusterService::FetchNodePoolUpgradeInfoRequest

FetchNodePoolUpgradeInfoRequest fetches the upgrade information of a
node pool.

Inherits from L<Protobuf::Message>.

=head3 Accessors

=over 4

=item * C<< $msg->name() >> / C<< $msg->name($value) >>

Type: C<String>

Required. The name (project, location, cluster, node pool) of the node pool
to get. Specified in the format
`projects/*/locations/*/clusters/*/nodePools/*` or
`projects/*/zones/*/clusters/*/nodePools/*`.

=item * C<< $msg->version() >> / C<< $msg->version($value) >>

Type: C<String>

API request version that initiates this operation.

=back

=head2 Google::Container::V1::ClusterService::NodePoolUpgradeInfo

NodePoolUpgradeInfo contains the upgrade information of a node pool.

Inherits from L<Protobuf::Message>.

=head3 Accessors

=over 4

=item * C<< $msg->minor_target_version() >> / C<< $msg->minor_target_version($value) >>

Type: C<String>

minor_target_version indicates the target version for minor upgrade.

=item * C<< $msg->patch_target_version() >> / C<< $msg->patch_target_version($value) >>

Type: C<String>

patch_target_version indicates the target version for patch upgrade.

=item * C<< $msg->auto_upgrade_status() >> / C<< $msg->auto_upgrade_status($value) >>

Type: C<Enum> (L<Google::Container::V1::NodePoolUpgradeInfo::AutoUpgradeStatus>)

The auto upgrade status.

=item * C<< $msg->paused_reason() >> / C<< $msg->paused_reason($value) >>

Type: C<Enum> (L<Google::Container::V1::NodePoolUpgradeInfo::AutoUpgradePausedReason>)

The auto upgrade paused reason.

=item * C<< $msg->upgrade_details() >> / C<< $msg->upgrade_details($value) >>

Type: C<Message> (L<Google::Container::V1::ClusterService::UpgradeDetails>)

The list of past auto upgrades.

=item * C<< $msg->end_of_standard_support_timestamp() >> / C<< $msg->end_of_standard_support_timestamp($value) >>

Type: C<String>

The node pool's current minor version's end of standard support timestamp.

=item * C<< $msg->end_of_extended_support_timestamp() >> / C<< $msg->end_of_extended_support_timestamp($value) >>

Type: C<String>

The node pool's current minor version's end of extended support timestamp.

=item * C<< $msg->custom_image_info() >> / C<< $msg->custom_image_info($value) >>

Type: C<Message> (L<Google::Container::V1::ClusterService::CustomImageInfo>)

Output only. Upgrade info for the node pool specific to the usage of custom
images.

=back

